src/ - WMA v2 audio decoder (libwam-wmcodecs.dylib).
  WMA has no public specification. The bitstream layout, the Huffman, band and
  LSP tables, and the reconstruction arithmetic come from FFmpeg's
  reverse-engineered WMA decoder (libavcodec/wma.c, wmadec.c, wmadata.h,
  aactab.c, wma_freqs.c; copyright (c) 2002 The FFmpeg Project and
  contributors, LGPL-2.1-or-later). The tables in src/wma_tables.h are copied
  from those files; the decoder in src/wma_decoder.cpp is a C++ rewrite of
  their algorithm.

wmv3/ - WMV3 (SMPTE 421M VC-1 Simple/Main profile) video decoder.
  The decoding process, DSP routines (wmv3_dsp.c) and tables (wmv3_tables.h)
  are derived from FFmpeg's libavcodec (vc1*.c, vc1dsp.c, vc1data.c,
  vc1acdata.h, vc1_vlc_data.h, msmpeg4_vc1_data.c, wmv2data.c),
  Copyright (c) the FFmpeg developers, including Konstantin Shishkov and
  others credited in those files, licensed LGPL-2.1-or-later.

